X-SOURCE:UofT St. Michael's College
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260613T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260613T160000
DTSTAMP:20260609T001453
CREATED:20260605T155744Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260605T160001Z
UID:10007543-1781343000-1781366400@stmikes.utoronto.ca
SUMMARY:Welcome Day
DESCRIPTION:The University of St. Michael’s College cordially invites newly admitted students joining SMC in September 2026 to our Welcome Day on Saturday\, June 13\, 2026. \n\n\n\n\nIncoming students will have the opportunity to acquaint themselves with our college.\n\n\n\nMeet upper-year students and staff.\n\n\n\nReceive information about course selection; fees; financial aid; student services; residence life; the Academic Success Centre\, including Writing and Research Help; the John M. Kelly Library; SMC Ones; SMC Programs; and other campus resources.\n\n\n\nTour the campus.\n\n\n\n\nView the full schedule and be sure to register.
URL:https://stmikes.utoronto.ca/event/welcome-day-2
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://stmikes.utoronto.ca/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/brennan-hall-summer-door-open-IMG_3213-1.png
END:VEVENT
